{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16232600","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16232600","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1623260001:0":{"text":"혹시... 어떻게 하면 가축이 될 수 있는지 가르쳐 주실 수 있나요?","source_cn":"也许……你可以告诉我，怎样才能成为家畜？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10736A4C8057A8F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1623260002:0":{"text":"가축 생활이 꽤 괜찮아 보여서요. 먹을 것도 있고, 마실 것도 있고, 주인에게 계속 돌봄과 관심을 받을 수 있잖아요.","source_cn":"我觉得家畜这份工作很不错，有吃有喝，还可以被主人一直照...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE9908464791D38D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1623260003:0":{"text":"메에... 가축이 뭐가 좋아... 결국 기다리는 건 같은 결말뿐이야. 어서 도망쳐...","source_cn":"咩……家畜有什么好，大家最后只有那个结局，快逃……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x544E8505AA24D7F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1623260004:1":{"text":"같은 결말이요...? 그게 뭔가요?","source_cn":"是什么结局……？完全不懂。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7701C22E59CBB2A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1623260005:1":{"text":"하아, 칸델이 있었다면... 걘 똑똑해서 양 씨의 말을 이해할 수 있었을 텐데.","source_cn":"呼，要是坎德尔在就好了，他比我聪明多，一定可以理解羊先...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1AC7E67E7E6C5EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1623260006:1":{"text":"일자리는 구했나 모르겠네. 정말, 이야기를 나누고 싶다니까...","source_cn":"不知道他找到工作了没有，好想和他聊聊天啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA18E1882D8CE8D33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1623260007:1":{"text":"이봐, 친구!","source_cn":"嘿！伙计！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6BACA19058D7B40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1623260008:0":{"text":"칸델! 그리고 마법사님!","source_cn":"是坎德尔！还有魔法师大人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A9017DD924D40C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1623260009:0":{"text":"잘 지냈어? 오랜만이잖아. 내 착각인가... 촛불이 예전보다 좀 더 어두워진 것 같은데?","source_cn":"怎么样啊？有阵子没见了——是我的错觉吗，怎么觉得你的烛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x484DF9262C79D9F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1623260010:0":{"text":"그, 그런가? 일자리를 찾느라 지쳐서 그런가 봐. 아무도 날 조명용 촛불로 쓰려고 하지 않고, 야간 경비도 맡겨주지 않았거든.","source_cn":"有、有吗？可能是因为找工作太累了，毕竟既没有人愿意让我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F6EB0A335B143E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1623260010":{"text":"그, 그런가? 일자리를 찾느라 지쳐서 그런가 봐. 아무도 날 조명용 촛불로 쓰려고 하지 않고, 야간 경비도 맡겨주지 않았거든.","source_cn":"有、有吗？可能是因为找工作太累了，毕竟既没有人愿意让我当照明蜡烛，也没有人觉得我能做夜班守卫……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F6EB0A335B143E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1623260011:0":{"text":"초대장이요? 저한테요? 대체 누가 저에게 일자리를... 그것도 마법사님께 직접 부탁해서...","source_cn":"邀请？是给我的吗？居然有人邀请我工作，还能请到魔法师大...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDC13A912472DA254","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"초대장이요? 저한테요? 대체 누가 저에게 일자리를... 그것도 마법사님께 직접 부탁해서...","female":"초대장이요? 저한테요? 대체 누가 저에게 일자리를... 그것도 마법사님께 직접 부탁해서...","variant_male_record_index":"219037","variant_female_record_index":"219038","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1623260011":{"text":"초대장이요? 저한테요? 대체 누가 저에게 일자리를... 그것도 마법사님께 직접 부탁해서...","source_cn":"邀请？是给我的吗？居然有人邀请我工作，还能请到魔法师大人来送这份邀请书？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDC13A912472DA254","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"초대장이요? 저한테요? 대체 누가 저에게 일자리를... 그것도 마법사님께 직접 부탁해서...","female":"초대장이요? 저한테요? 대체 누가 저에게 일자리를... 그것도 마법사님께 직접 부탁해서...","variant_male_record_index":"219037","variant_female_record_index":"219038","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1623260012:0":{"text":"정말요? 동물들이... 정말 그렇게 말했나요? 정말로 저희를 받아주겠대요?","source_cn":"真的吗？他们……真是那么说的？他们真的愿意试着接纳我们？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9A1B986680E276F6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"정말요? 동물들이... 정말 그렇게 말했나요? 정말로 저희를 받아주겠대요?","female":"정말요? 동물들이... 정말 그렇게 말했나요? 정말로 저희를 받아주겠대요?","variant_male_record_index":"219039","variant_female_record_index":"219040","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1623260012":{"text":"정말요? 동물들이... 정말 그렇게 말했나요? 정말로 저희를 받아주겠대요?","source_cn":"真的吗？他们……真是那么说的？他们真的愿意试着接纳我们？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9A1B986680E276F6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"정말요? 동물들이... 정말 그렇게 말했나요? 정말로 저희를 받아주겠대요?","female":"정말요? 동물들이... 정말 그렇게 말했나요? 정말로 저희를 받아주겠대요?","variant_male_record_index":"219039","variant_female_record_index":"219040","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1623260013:1":{"text":"믿기지 않아! 칸델, 이제 어떡하지? 다시... 돌아갈까?","source_cn":"简直难以置信！坎德尔，我们该怎么办，要不要……回去？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x780A3B9E1FA902EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1623260014:1":{"text":"사실... 나 요즘 숲이 계속 그리웠어. 나쁜 일들도 기억나지만, 풀과 나무 냄새, 나뭇잎이 흔들리는 소리를 떠올리는 것만으로도... 마음이 편안해져.","source_cn":"其实……我这段时间一直很想念森林的生活。那些糟糕的事我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AA170C39EC0F8C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1623260015:1":{"text":"이상하지. 나는 인간이 만든 마법 창조물인데, 매일 솔잎이 깔린 푹신한 흙을 밟던 감촉이 그리워...","source_cn":"真奇怪，我明明是人类创造的魔法造物，却每天都在怀念脚踩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB13DCC482C068B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1623260016:1":{"text":"크흠, 나... 나도 그래.","source_cn":"咳，我……也是的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5969F1D5E26201C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1623260017:1":{"text":"우리는 동물들의 반대 때문에 숲을 떠났던 거잖아. 이제는 마음을 바꿨다면, 우리도 다시 돌아갈 수 있는 거지... 그렇지?","source_cn":"我们是因为动物们的反对才离开森林的，既然现在他们改变了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD227F975060E9091","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1623260018:1":{"text":"우리에게 다른 선택지가 없는 것처럼 말하지 마. 숲이 그렇게 대단한 곳도 아니잖아...","source_cn":"别说得好像我们没有其他选择了似的，森林也没什么了不起的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5960BC3F24ED13B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1623260019:1":{"text":"하지만 동물들이 우리를 초대했으니까... 어디에도 없는 마법 창조물인 우리가 넓은 마음으로 받아들여야지. 이건... 맞아, 예의야!","source_cn":"不过既然那群动物向我们发出了邀请，作为独二无三的魔法造...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FC4515692DA1A8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1623260020:0":{"text":"좋아!","source_cn":"好啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17E1FCB01729068B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1623260021:1":{"text":"두 마법 창조물이 마음을 모으자 촛불이 다시 밝아지고, 칸델도 한층 더 기운을 차린 것 같았다.","source_cn":"在他们达成了一致决定之后，小蜡烛的火焰“噗”地亮了一截...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DCD6A3A623DE72C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1623260022:1":{"text":"하지만 설렘은 잠시뿐, 창조물들은 동시에 동물들이 자신들을 거절하던 말과 시선을 떠올린 듯 갑자기 느릿해졌다.","source_cn":"但兴奋只有一瞬，两人似乎同时回想起了动物们拒绝他们时的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2221E3F66E3D91F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1623260023:0":{"text":"칸델...","source_cn":"坎德尔……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x315EB43F7E5EBB0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1623260024:1":{"text":"알아. 우리의 소원을 이루기 위해서 한 번 더 돌아가 보자는 거야. 안 되면... 다시 떠나면 되는 거니까.","source_cn":"我明白的，就当是为了实现我们自己的愿望，再回去一次。大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88EECFEC12D31669","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1623260025:1":{"text":"응...","source_cn":"嗯……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8CF0592B7A0AD3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:33:1623260025":{"text":"응...","source_cn":"嗯……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8CF0592B7A0AD3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1623260026:1":{"text":"결정했어요. 숲으로 돌아갈게요.","source_cn":"决定了，我们——回森林。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x732E7DCDEE1F0BA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1623260027:1":{"text":"가죠, 마법사님.","source_cn":"现在就出发吧，魔法师大人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE7E11367698FEA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:33:0:1":{"text":"결정했어?","source_cn":"你们决定了吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7120694C95D8AE3A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"결정했어?","female":"결정했어?","variant_male_record_index":"86915","variant_female_record_index":"86916","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:17:0:1":{"text":"거짓말일 리 있겠어?","source_cn":"那还能有假？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3AD983CB8B82C915","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"거짓말일 리 있겠어?","female":"거짓말일 리 있겠어?","variant_male_record_index":"86911","variant_female_record_index":"86912","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:17:1:2":{"text":"내 명예를 걸고 보증할게!","source_cn":"我以我的名誉担保！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE79C798882AC416F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"내 명예를 걸고 보증할게!","female":"내 명예를 걸고 보증할게!","variant_m